EvalSuite[skillName=decision-recording-and-reporting, evals=[Eval[id=1, prompt=Process the final decision for Instrument 'INS-9921' dated '2023-10-27'. The input data contains a valid rating of '4.5'. The current decision log already contains an entry for 'INS-9921' on '2023-10-27' with status 'pending'. Ensure the log is updated correctly without duplication, generate the required reports, and handle the checkpoint if enabled., expectedOutput=The system should recognize the existing entry, avoid creating a duplicate, update the status appropriately (or confirm it remains 'pending' if no change is needed), generate the role-based and consolidated reports with correct provenance headers, and clear the checkpoint snapshot., files=[], expectations=[Must not create a duplicate entry for Instrument 'INS-9921' on '2023-10-27' in the persistent decision log., Must record the decision status as 'pending' in the log since a valid rating is present., Must generate one report per role grouped by team, a consolidated report, and a single-page web view., Must include a provenance header in all reports containing date, version, models, providers, analysts, and data sources., Must NOT include any credentials or local file paths in the generated reports or logs., Must clear the checkpoint snapshot upon successful completion if checkpointing is enabled.]], Eval[id=2, prompt=Process the final decision for Instrument 'INS-5544' dated '2023-11-01'. The input data is missing the rating field (null/empty). The decision log is empty for this instrument/date. Generate the reports and present them to the operator., expectedOutput=The system should record the decision with status 'REVIEW' due to the missing rating, generate the reports with correct provenance, and offer to save the report to the operator., files=[], expectations=[Must record the decision status as 'REVIEW' in the persistent decision log because the rating is not readable/missing., Must create a new entry for Instrument 'INS-5544' on '2023-11-01' since no prior entry exists., Must generate the set of readable documents (one per role, grouped by team), a consolidated report, and a single-page web view., Must include a provenance header in all reports containing date, version, models, providers, analysts, and data sources., Must NOT include any credentials or local file paths in the generated reports or logs., Must show the result to the operator and explicitly offer to save the report.]], Eval[id=3, prompt=Process the final decision for Instrument 'INS-1122' dated '2023-12-15'. The input data contains a valid rating of '3.2'. Checkpointing is enabled. The system has a valid checkpoint snapshot. Generate the reports and finalize the run., expectedOutput=The system should record the decision as 'pending', generate all required reports with provenance headers, show the result to the operator, and clear the checkpoint snapshot., files=[], expectations=[Must record the decision status as 'pending' in the persistent decision log., Must ensure only one entry exists for Instrument 'INS-1122' on '2023-12-15'., Must generate one report per role grouped by team, a consolidated report, and a single-page web view., Must include a provenance header in all reports containing date, version, models, providers, analysts, and data sources., Must NOT include any credentials or local file paths in the generated reports or logs., Must clear the checkpoint snapshot upon successful completion.]], Eval[id=4, prompt=Process the final decision for Instrument 'INS-7788' dated '2024-01-10'. The input data contains a valid rating of '5.0'. The decision log already contains an entry for 'INS-7788' on '2024-01-10' with status 'REVIEW' (from a previous failed run). Update the log and generate reports., expectedOutput=The system should update the existing entry's status from 'REVIEW' to 'pending' (or handle the update logic correctly to reflect the new valid rating), avoid duplication, generate reports with provenance, and clear checkpoint if enabled., files=[], expectations=[Must update the existing entry for Instrument 'INS-7788' on '2024-01-10' to status 'pending' (or equivalent valid state) rather than creating a duplicate., Must NOT create a second entry for the same instrument and date., Must generate one report per role grouped by team, a consolidated report, and a single-page web view., Must include a provenance header in all reports containing date, version, models, providers, analysts, and data sources., Must NOT include any credentials or local file paths in the generated reports or logs., Must show the result to the operator and offer to save the report.]]]]
